# Prestium 2.1 (audit of 96468c5, M-1): for the viewers that save files (GIMP, Audacity, the text
# editor, the archive managers, the metadata cleaners): write in the user's file folders and unlocked
# volumes. Never in the Tor Browser's download folder (read only), the home directory itself or any
# dot directory, so a crafted file can't plant a configuration or start-up file.
  owner @{HOME}/{Desktop,Documents,Downloads,Pictures,Music,Videos,Public,Templates,OnionShare}/ rw,
  owner @{HOME}/{Desktop,Documents,Downloads,Pictures,Music,Videos,Public,Templates,OnionShare}/** rwkl,
  /media/** rwk,
